# Version

Only bump the version when the user asks you to commit. Do not bump it as part of ordinary code changes.

When committing, bump the last number of the version: `0.1.1` becomes `0.1.2`.

Keep these three in step with `footy_cheat/__init__.py`:

- `pyproject.toml` `version`
- a new `<release>` at the top of `data/io.github.kakwit.FootyCheat.metainfo.xml`, dated today, leaving older releases in place

Leave the first two numbers alone unless asked.
